{"step_index":1024,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-14T03:04:13Z","input_tokens":2986,"cache_read_tokens":161469,"output_tokens":659,"thinking":"Observed that the YouTube channel \"군림보\" has the business email `grb@sandbox.co.kr`. Confirmed the associated MCN/agency as **Sandbox Network**. Further confirmed that the individual creator, 군림보 (Choi Woo-ram), has a personal company named **(주)지알비**. This suggests a possible link between the email address and this company. Exploring official fan platforms and business registration details to determine the connection.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"node -e \\\"\\nconst net = require('net');\\n\\nfunction queryWhois(domain) {\\n  return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\\n    const socket = net.createConnection(43, 'whois.krnic.net', () => {\\n      socket.write(domain + '\\\\r\\\\n');\\n    });\\n    let data = '';\\n    socket.on('data', chunk => { data += chunk.toString('utf8'); });\\n    socket.on('end', () => resolve(data));\\n    socket.on('error', err => reject(err));\\n  });\\n}\\n\\nasync function testDomains() {\\n  const list = ['grb.co.kr', 'grb.kr', 'goolimbo.co.kr', 'goolimbo.kr'];\\n  for (const d of list) {\\n    const res = await queryWhois(d);\\n    console.log('=== ' + d + ' ===');\\n    const registrant = res.match(/등록인\\\\s*:\\\\s*([^\\\\r\\\\n]+)/);\\n    const phone = res.match(/책임자 전화번호\\\\s*:\\\\s*([^\\\\r\\\\n]+)/);\\n    console.log('Registrant:', registrant ? registrant[1] : 'NONE');\\n    console.log('Phone:', phone ? phone[1] : 'NONE');\\n  }\\n}\\ntestDomains();\\n\\\"\"","Cwd":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\worktrees\\\\resilient-bardeen\\\\find_company_phone_numbers\"","IsDaemon":"false","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"5000","toolAction":"\"Querying whois for GRB domains\"","toolSummary":"\"Query whois for GRB domains\""}}]}
